      "ref": "main",
      "_comment": "Flutter build pipeline composed under its contract paths ({app_name}.builder.tasks._generate_flutter_app, {app_name}/builder/source_code). Source mirrors the rcore shell's committed composer.json, where builder replaced the 'dev' entry (../corporate/dev/frappe); the two cannot coexist — both ship the flutter_app_configuration / flutter_build_settings doctypes and the composer hard-fails on duplicate DocTypes."
